%%{init: {"theme": "base", "themeVariables": {"fontFamily": "Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif", "fontSize": "15px"}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Browser
  participant API as FastAPI (Container Apps)
  participant M as Microsoft Foundry model
  participant B as Baseline lane (no rules)
  participant G as ACS governed lane
  U->>API: POST /api/compare (prompt, persona, model, toggles)
  API->>API: size check, rate limit, build persona snapshot server-side
  API-->>U: run.started + step events (NDJSON, seq 1..n)
  API->>M: structured output: pick ONE bank tool
  M-->>API: tool name + args (+ token usage, response model)
  API-->>U: model.usage + tool.selected
  API->>B: run tool directly
  B-->>API: raw result (fake SSN visible)
  API-->>U: lane.result (baseline)
  API->>G: check 1: input
  API->>G: check 2: pre-tool (assignment, limits, approvals)
  alt allowed
    API->>G: run tool, check 3: post-tool redaction
  else blocked or needs approval
    G-->>API: deny / escalate (tool not run)
  end
  API-->>U: lane.result (governed) + run.completed
  opt approval required
    U->>API: POST /api/approval (approve or reject)
    API->>G: re-evaluate, run only if still allowed
    API-->>U: final governed result
  end
